    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this fantastic 2 bed / 2 bath apartment in Oak House, Carrickmines, Dublin 18.\nThis bright and spacious apartment comes fully furnished throughout and offers a generous open-plan kitchen/living/dining area, leading to a private balcony with stunning panoramic views of the Wicklow mountains, two well-proportioned bedrooms and 2 bathrooms including 1 ensuite. The apartment also comes with 1 underground car space.\nIn terms of location, Carrickmines is a highly sought-after area, close to Carrickmines Retail Park, The Park shopping centre, and within easy reach of the M50 and N11. The development is a short drive from Leopardstown and Sandyford, and well positioned for both city-bound and coastal routes. Local bus routes serve the area, with the Luas Green Line also accessible nearby, offering a convenient link into Dublin City Centre.\nFeatures:\n1. Fully Furnished\n2. 2 Double Bedrooms\n3. 2 Bathrooms (Main En-Suite)\n4. Fully Furnished\n5. Open-Plan Kitchen/Living/Dining Area\n6. Private Balcony with Panoramic Views\n7. Modern Fitted Kitchen\n8. 1 Underground Car Space\n9. Excellent, Well-Maintained Condition Throughout\n10. Close to Carrickmines Retail Park, The Park Shopping Centre, M50/N11, Bus Routes and Luas Green Line\nENQUIRIES BY EMAIL ONLY PLEASE."
      },
      {
